+// WebCrypto on the Amiga without a crypto library. The engine links no
+// OpenSSL (curl does TLS through OpenTLS), so crypto.subtle offers the
+// digests only, SHA-1 and SHA-2, which PAL's CryptoDigest computes itself.
+// Every other algorithm is left out of the registry, so a page asking for one
+// gets NotSupportedError; the platform functions below are never reached and
+// exist so that the algorithm and key classes link.
+
